- U | find out exactly why it failed before touching anything else | v: self-direction | aim: work | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 75
- B | make the next piece so good that nobody remembers this one | v: power, achievement | aim: work | foot: means time-.05 | chance: 60
- R | walk away from {aim.doing} for good, and mean it | v: stimulation, self-direction | aim: stop | foot: lesson knowing when it is done | chance: 70
- G | set {aim.doing} aside and turn back to the people at home | v: benevolence, security | aim: stop | foot: mark learned a skill | chance: 85
- W>U | go back to the first steps and rebuild the method, piece by piece | v: conformity, self-direction | aim: work | foot: lesson the basics hold everything up | chance: 72
- U>B | quietly ask the people it was for what went wrong, and win them back | v: self-direction, power | aim: work | foot: person regular | chance: 62
- B>R | put it down to bad luck and take on a harder job at once | v: power, stimulation | aim: work | foot: mark took a wild risk | chance: 55
- R>G | let it go for now, and keep close to the friend who stood by through it | v: stimulation, benevolence | aim: stop | foot: person friend | chance: 80
- G>W | stay on and finish the season you promised, then decide | v: tradition, conformity | aim: work | foot: door kept your word | chance: 78
works: {N} goes back, does it again, and this time it holds.
works: In a year it is a story {N} tells at the table, laughing.
fails: The failure follows {N} for a while; people mention it before anything else.
fails: {Ns} hands are slow and careful for months, as if waiting for the next one.

